	(text "IO45, IO46: strapping pins, keep open"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d488755b-e4d9-5de8-b8e4-a7ae591c90db")
	)
	(text "- Module: 16 MB flash, 8 MB octal PSRAM.\n- IO15 / IO16 are RTC GPIOs: ext1 wake sources\n  (Talk, wheel push). IO21 (PGOOD_N) is RTC-capable too.\n- GPIO numbers match embedded/main/Kconfig.projbuild,\n  plus IO8 (AMP_EN), IO9 (OLED_VCC_EN), IO1, IO2, IO21.\n- IO3, IO45, IO46 are strapping pins and stay open.\n- Deep sleep: hold the OLED and I2S outputs (gpio_hold_en)\n  so panel and microphone inputs never float.\n- Keep the antenna end clear of copper, battery, speaker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.04 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f5d99c57-b7a0-539c-89b3-52b02171a99a")
	)
